@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+5BSD import status
+==================
+
+This is a subset of connectedhomeip: the Matter IDL tooling
+(scripts/py_matter_idl) and the data files its tests read.  The rest of the
+upstream archive is not imported because parts of it may not be
+redistributed; the include list in tools/build/fuchsia/sources.json defines
+the subset.  See tools/build/fuchsia/README and contrib/README.5BSD.
+
+This is not an installed capability service.  Matter devices,
+commissioning and physical Thread radio operation are not part of 5BSD.
